{"comments":[],"camx":1610.1668701171875,"camy":1838.1663818359375,"starting_node":-4.0,"events":[],"textboxes":[{"portrait":-4.0,"x":640.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":400.0,"connect0_ID":61.0,"ID":0.0,"text":"Can't say I've seen a wrecking crew use bombs before."},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":1376.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":400.0,"connect0_ID":2.0,"ID":1.0,"text":"Here's a tip."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":880.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":496.0,"ID":2.0,"text":"Woah! Thanks, brudda!<break>Pleasure workin' with 'ya."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":976.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":576.0,"ID":3.0,"text":"Tell 'ya friends!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":624.0,"portrait_ind":4.0,"y":672.0,"connect0_ID":52.0,"ID":4.0,"text":"Dat was WICKED!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1232.0,"portrait_ind":6.0,"y":672.0,"connect0_ID":7.0,"ID":6.0,"text":"We totally KILLED it!<break>And we even got a tip!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1280.0,"portrait_ind":94.0,"y":816.0,"connect0_ID":8.0,"ID":7.0,"text":"Whatcha wanna spend it on, Buster?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":752.0,"portrait_ind":25.0,"y":816.0,"connect0_ID":9.0,"ID":8.0,"text":"You was the one who knocked down five whole stories..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":736.0,"portrait_ind":26.0,"y":912.0,"connect0_ID":10.0,"ID":9.0,"text":"Dontch'a think a dynamite gal like yourself deserves to pick?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1296.0,"portrait_ind":88.0,"y":928.0,"connect0_ID":11.0,"ID":10.0,"text":"Teehee... stop it, you..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1504.0,"portrait_ind":89.0,"y":912.0,"connect0_ID":12.0,"ID":11.0,"text":"I mean...<break>I know what we could do..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1648.0,"portrait_ind":53.0,"y":1024.0,"connect0_ID":13.0,"ID":12.0,"text":"..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1264.0,"portrait_ind":85.0,"y":1072.0,"connect0_ID":14.0,"ID":13.0,"text":"Get in our PJs, order a pizza, and rent Dinosaurus 2:<pause 20> Return of the Apes"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1056.0,"portrait_ind":26.0,"y":1056.0,"connect0_ID":15.0,"ID":14.0,"text":"You read my friggin' mind."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":640.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1040.0,"ID":15.0,"text":"Come on, Bridget. Let's pack up so we can head home and chill."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":656.0,"portrait_ind":26.0,"y":1184.0,"ID":16.0,"text":"Um... <nopause>Hi!<pause 18> (???)"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":896.0,"portrait_ind":23.0,"y":1168.0,"connect0_ID":18.0,"ID":17.0,"text":"Was that a grody?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1024.0,"portrait_ind":14.0,"y":1200.0,"ID":18.0,"text":"Wait a minute... if that's a grody...<break>Then that means..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":848.0,"portrait_ind":35.0,"y":1328.0,"connect0_ID":21.0,"ID":19.0,"text":"The Wizard..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":592.0,"portrait_ind":6.0,"y":1328.0,"connect0_ID":19.0,"ID":20.0,"text":"Yeah you can just put that over there."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":1024.0,"portrait_ind":10.0,"y":1328.0,"ID":21.0,"text":"What the-"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":608.0,"portrait_ind":43.0,"y":1440.0,"connect0_ID":23.0,"ID":22.0,"text":"Uuuggggghhhhhhhhhh."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":848.0,"portrait_ind":48.0,"y":1424.0,"connect0_ID":24.0,"ID":23.0,"text":"I thought I already put you and your scheme back into retirement, old man."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":1264.0,"portrait_ind":5.0,"y":1424.0,"connect0_ID":60.0,"ID":24.0,"text":"Your nose is looking bigger than usual, Bomb Boy."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1696.0,"portrait_ind":44.0,"y":1536.0,"ID":25.0,"text":"<pitch 1.2><shake 2>SHUT 'YA MOUTH!!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":896.0,"portrait_ind":1.0,"y":1536.0,"connect0_ID":27.0,"ID":26.0,"text":"Why don't you and your little girlfriend go home? This doesn't involve you."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":464.0,"portrait_ind":40.0,"y":1536.0,"connect0_ID":28.0,"ID":27.0,"text":"You kill people for fun, so, yeah...<break>This kinda does involve us..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":576.0,"portrait_ind":24.0,"y":1648.0,"connect0_ID":29.0,"ID":28.0,"text":"Hahaha, that's true. That's awesome."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":912.0,"portrait_ind":1.0,"y":1648.0,"connect0_ID":30.0,"ID":29.0,"text":"Listen, I'd love to just stand around and play grab-ass, but I'm quite busy."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1328.0,"portrait_ind":27.0,"y":1664.0,"connect0_ID":51.0,"ID":30.0,"text":"Pffft. You'd love to grab my what?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":528.0,"portrait_ind":48.0,"y":1808.0,"connect0_ID":32.0,"ID":31.0,"text":"What do you mean, \"important business\"?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":880.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1792.0,"connect0_ID":57.0,"ID":32.0,"text":"<noskip>That is none of your concern..."},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":1744.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1808.0,"connect0_ID":34.0,"ID":33.0,"text":"So, I wasn't gonna say anything, I'm not really one to tattle..."},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":1312.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1936.0,"connect0_ID":35.0,"ID":34.0,"text":"But <nopause>Goblin Jr. has<yespause> barely helped us take over<break>the city. He's just... sitting around."},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":896.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1936.0,"connect0_ID":53.0,"ID":35.0,"text":"So, naturally, I told him if he doesn't get up,<break>I'd kill him."},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":80.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1952.0,"connect0_ID":37.0,"ID":36.0,"text":"<auto 5>Do you think you could-"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":496.0,"portrait_ind":42.0,"y":2064.0,"ID":37.0,"text":"<pitch 1.1><shake 2>YOU ARE RUINING MY EVIL OPENING!!!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":848.0,"portrait_ind":19.0,"y":2080.0,"connect0_ID":39.0,"ID":38.0,"text":"Heh, the <wave>plan<wave> is coming into <wave>motion<wave>..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":1264.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":2080.0,"connect0_ID":40.0,"ID":39.0,"text":"You two.<break>Stay out of this."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":1328.0,"portrait_ind":29.0,"y":2192.0,"connect0_ID":41.0,"ID":40.0,"text":"As you can see, I have my own matters to attend to."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":896.0,"portrait_ind":2.0,"y":2192.0,"connect0_ID":42.0,"ID":41.0,"text":"And I <shake 1>DON'T<shake 0> need you sniffing around."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":464.0,"portrait_ind":23.0,"y":2176.0,"connect0_ID":43.0,"ID":42.0,"text":"I'll be sure to save you a seat for the opening premiere of <wave><hueshift>Wizardtopia<hueshift><wave>."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":560.0,"portrait_ind":31.0,"y":2320.0,"ID":43.0,"text":"So long for now, Bomb Boy."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":496.0,"portrait_ind":49.0,"y":2480.0,"ID":44.0,"text":"Oh yeah, you too Bridget.<break>I gotta get better with that, sorry."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":944.0,"portrait_ind":44.0,"y":2496.0,"connect0_ID":46.0,"ID":45.0,"text":"Wizardtopia??"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1088.0,"portrait_ind":24.0,"y":2496.0,"connect0_ID":47.0,"ID":46.0,"text":"Not the most creative name, but alright."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)","x":1120.0,"portrait_ind":81.0,"y":2608.0,"connect0_ID":48.0,"ID":47.0,"text":"BUSTER!! What is that thing!?<break>What are we gonna do!?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":992.0,"portrait_ind":39.0,"y":2624.0,"connect0_ID":49.0,"ID":48.0,"text":"I dunno..."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":656.0,"portrait_ind":40.0,"y":2624.0,"connect0_ID":50.0,"ID":49.0,"text":"But we ain't gonna stand around and find out."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":768.0,"portrait_ind":1.0,"y":2736.0,"ID":50.0,"text":"Come on, Bridget!"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1632.0,"portrait_ind":28.0,"y":1664.0,"ID":51.0,"text":"<auto 10>You hear that, Bridget? He said he wants to grab my-"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":816.0,"portrait_ind":5.0,"y":672.0,"connect0_ID":6.0,"ID":52.0,"text":"We oughta be the best wrecking crew in all of Boomtown."},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":480.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1920.0,"connect0_ID":54.0,"ID":53.0,"text":"But Ball thought I was talking to him, so now he's crying and..."},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":112.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1856.0,"connect0_ID":36.0,"ID":54.0,"text":"Heh, it's just sort of a whole thing."},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":1552.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":2368.0,"ID":55.0,"text":"Hello! ThisTextBoxHasAn<wave><col red>effect<col white><wave>Isn'tThatCool"},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":1584.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":2480.0,"ID":56.0,"text":"<center>This text is centered...<break>Isn't that cool and awesome?"},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_wizard)","x":1168.0,"portrait_ind":2.0,"y":1792.0,"connect0_ID":59.0,"ID":57.0,"text":"<auto 10>Stay out of my way, or I'll-"},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":1520.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":1808.0,"connect0_ID":33.0,"ID":59.0,"text":"<auto 90>Hey Wizard."},{"portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)","x":1360.0,"portrait_ind":35.0,"y":1520.0,"connect0_ID":26.0,"ID":60.0,"text":"Your mudda."},{"portrait":-4.0,"x":1072.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"y":400.0,"connect0_ID":1.0,"ID":61.0,"text":"Mighty fine work, you two."}],"ID_TOTAL":62.0,"cam_zoom_count":1.0,"choices":[],"portraits":[]}